# ----- LEGENDARY badges: the rarest on Eschool -----
# Each one needs several hard things at the same time, so no single habit is enough.
# They take many months (most take a full year or more) and are numbered: the page shows
# how many learners hold each one and which number you were to earn it.
# key, title, motto, icon, theme, [(stat, target, what it means)]
